      "text": "est ≤ remaining × 0.8   → dispatch\nest ≤ remaining         → dispatch, flag AMBER\nest >  remaining        → hold, then in order:\n   frontier task → drop a tier · pack > 60% est_in → trim\n   phase at 80%  → Musts only · at 100% → Ask Card to you\n   throttled     → checkpoint DAG, resume next session",
