      "text": "⑧ TIER POLICY — frontier thinks, low tier executes\n◆ FRONTIER  brainstorm · plan · review · QA\n            TL · PM · BA · SA · CR · QA · SE\n○ LOW TIER  execution · fix · debug\n            FE · BE · DB · DO · Uma · TW · RM · SR\n            ESCALATE: 1st attempt low tier, retry goes\n            frontier — symptom patching is the risk\n⚙ 0 TOKENS  dispatch checks · merge · ledger · velocity\n            CHANGELOG · Index · done-when · reports\n\nJudgment is where money buys quality; typing is not.\nParallel only if write sets don't overlap",
      "originalText": "⑧ TIER POLICY — frontier thinks, low tier executes\n◆ FRONTIER  brainstorm · plan · review · QA\n            TL · PM · BA · SA · CR · QA · SE\n○ LOW TIER  execution · fix · debug\n            FE · BE · DB · DO · Uma · TW · RM · SR\n            ESCALATE: 1st attempt low tier, retry goes\n            frontier — symptom patching is the risk\n⚙ 0 TOKENS  dispatch checks · merge · ledger · velocity\n            CHANGELOG · Index · done-when · reports\n\nJudgment is where money buys quality; typing is not.\nParallel only if write sets don't overlap",
