      "text": "Rules\n1. CODE: one owner per path glob; the owner writes directly\n2. SHARED DOCS: nobody writes them but TW-Tessa (the scribe)\n3. To change a shared doc, append a record to your own\n   updates/<agent>-<task>.md — never edit the doc itself\n   ⇒ private file per agent, so two agents can never collide\n4. Agents never wait on the scribe; they append and keep going\n5. ⚙ scheduler batches updates/ at each merge point;\n   scribe applies the batch in one pass, one voice, one index\n6. Conflicting records in one batch → scribe raises it to TL-Theo,\n   TL decides, scribe logs the D-id.  Doc is never half-applied\n7. Generated files are never hand-edited, not even by the scribe\n   (CHANGELOG · Index · ProgressTracker · types from contracts/)\n8. D-id changed → ⚙ scheduler re-queues every task that needs it\n9. Owner change = Decisions.md entry (via updates/, like everything)\n10. Estimates are never rewritten after the fact — ledger keeps\n    the original est next to the actual, always",
      "originalText": "Rules\n1. CODE: one owner per path glob; the owner writes directly\n2. SHARED DOCS: nobody writes them but TW-Tessa (the scribe)\n3. To change a shared doc, append a record to your own\n   updates/<agent>-<task>.md — never edit the doc itself\n   ⇒ private file per agent, so two agents can never collide\n4. Agents never wait on the scribe; they append and keep going\n5. ⚙ scheduler batches updates/ at each merge point;\n   scribe applies the batch in one pass, one voice, one index\n6. Conflicting records in one batch → scribe raises it to TL-Theo,\n   TL decides, scribe logs the D-id.  Doc is never half-applied\n7. Generated files are never hand-edited, not even by the scribe\n   (CHANGELOG · Index · ProgressTracker · types from contracts/)\n8. D-id changed → ⚙ scheduler re-queues every task that needs it\n9. Owner change = Decisions.md entry (via updates/, like everything)\n10. Estimates are never rewritten after the fact — ledger keeps\n    the original est next to the actual, always",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
