      "updated": 1789563478401,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "spent     412k tokens   vs 380k planned   +8%\npoints    34 done / 41 planned            83%\nvelocity  12.1k / point  (was 11.4k)      +6%\n\nWHERE IT WENT                tokens    %   vs est\n  ○ BE-Bruno   api layer      118k   29%   +40%  ▲\n  ○ FE-Felix   skeleton        94k   23%    +5%\n  ◆ SA-Silas   contracts       71k   17%   −12%\n  ◆ CR-Cyrus   review          58k   14%    +2%\n  everything else              71k   17%",
      "originalText": "spent     412k tokens   vs 380k planned   +8%\npoints    34 done / 41 planned            83%\nvelocity  12.1k / point  (was 11.4k)      +6%\n\nWHERE IT WENT                tokens    %   vs est\n  ○ BE-Bruno   api layer      118k   29%   +40%  ▲\n  ○ FE-Felix   skeleton        94k   23%    +5%\n  ◆ SA-Silas   contracts       71k   17%   −12%\n  ◆ CR-Cyrus   review          58k   14%    +2%\n  everything else              71k   17%",
