      "width": 604,
      "height": 157.5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "text": "WHEN IT STOPS WITHOUT A TRUE RULING   (all three hand back)\n\nSTALLED     same finding surviving 3 outer cycles\nCIRCLING    6+ exchanges in one inner loop, no ruling\n            → escalate the fixer, then hand back\nBUDGET      check 6 applies to loops too\nOUT OF SCOPE  the real defect is elsewhere → close, open a new loop\n\na stalled loop is information: usually a D-id, not more cycles",
      "originalText": "WHEN IT STOPS WITHOUT A TRUE RULING   (all three hand back)\n\nSTALLED     same finding surviving 3 outer cycles\nCIRCLING    6+ exchanges in one inner loop, no ruling\n            → escalate the fixer, then hand back\nBUDGET      check 6 applies to loops too\nOUT OF SCOPE  the real defect is elsewhere → close, open a new loop\n\na stalled loop is information: usually a D-id, not more cycles",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "24_Br1hi5-sD2l53rm6k3",
