      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "text": "READING A FINISHED LOOP — long is fine, REPEATING is the problem\n\n1 cycle, 2–3 exchanges     the defect was what it looked like · normal\n1 cycle, many exchanges    the fix was hard, the critique was right · fine\nmany cycles, short inners  A1 keeps missing what A3 catches — reviewing the symptom, not the callers\nmany cycles, long inners   under-specified · stop and write a D-id\n2+ fixer rejects           the critique could not be reproduced · A1 is guessing",
      "originalText": "READING A FINISHED LOOP — long is fine, REPEATING is the problem\n\n1 cycle, 2–3 exchanges     the defect was what it looked like · normal\n1 cycle, many exchanges    the fix was hard, the critique was right · fine\nmany cycles, short inners  A1 keeps missing what A3 catches — reviewing the symptom, not the callers\nmany cycles, long inners   under-specified · stop and write a D-id\n2+ fixer rejects           the critique could not be reproduced · A1 is guessing",
