      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "text": "⚙ pb.py loop — enforces whose turn it is\n\nloop open T-07 --scope \"one broken thing\"\nloop round T-07 --agent critic|fixer|gate \\\n     --verdict accept|reject --evidence \"…\"   ← mandatory\nloop status T-07      cycle · inner count · stall\nloop close  T-07      refused until the gate rules TRUE",
      "originalText": "⚙ pb.py loop — enforces whose turn it is\n\nloop open T-07 --scope \"one broken thing\"\nloop round T-07 --agent critic|fixer|gate \\\n     --verdict accept|reject --evidence \"…\"   ← mandatory\nloop status T-07      cycle · inner count · stall\nloop close  T-07      refused until the gate rules TRUE",
